{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-68908","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-130433","text":"FleetPrompt — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-68909","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130434","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-130435","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-130436","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-130437","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-130438","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-130439","text":" Full Implementation (Phoenix + OTP + Supabase)"}]},{"id":"blk-68910","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-130440","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-68911","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130441","text":"You are building "},{"id":"spn-130442","marks":["bold"],"text":"FleetPrompt"},{"id":"spn-130443","text":" — the open agent marketplace for the [&] Protocol ecosystem. FleetPrompt is the registry where production-ready AI agents are published, discovered, and deployed in one click. Every listed agent carries a versioned manifest, a computed trust score, declared permissions, and a linked SpecPrompt spec."}]},{"id":"blk-68912","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130444","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/README.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-130445","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-68913","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130446","text":"FleetPrompt is the "},{"id":"spn-130447","marks":["bold"],"text":"distribution layer"},{"id":"spn-130448","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-68914","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-68915","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130449","text":"FleetPrompt is also the "},{"id":"spn-130450","marks":["bold"],"text":"canonical trust broker"},{"id":"spn-130451","text":" of the [&] ecosystem — it aggregates PRISM CL scores, test coverage, usage data, and audit quality into a single trust score."}]},{"id":"blk-68916","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-130452","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-68917","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:     Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nFramework:    Phoenix 1.8+ (LiveView for real-time search, PubSub for trust broadcasts)\nDatabase:     PostgreSQL via shared Supabase (fleet.* schema, migration range 030-039)\nSearch:       pg_trgm + ts_vector (no external search infra)\nHot Cache:    ETS (:fp_manifests, :fp_trust_scores, :fp_search_index, :fp_categories)\nAudit:        Broadway pipeline (batched, append-only)\nBackground:   Oban (trust recompute, webhook delivery, search index refresh)\nAuth:         Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — amp.profiles, amp.workspaces)\nTelemetry:    :telemetry + Prometheus\nDeploy:       Mix release + Docker on Fly.io"},{"id":"blk-68918","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-130453","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-68919","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130454","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-130455","marks":["code"],"text":"fleetprompt.com/"},{"id":"spn-130456","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-68920","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"fleetprompt.com/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── fleet_prompt/\n│   │   ├── agents/\n│   │   │   └── agent.ex               # FleetPrompt.Agents.Agent schema (fleet.agents)\n│   │   ├── manifests/\n│   │   │   └── manifest.ex            # FleetPrompt.Manifests.Manifest schema (fleet.manifests)\n│   │   ├── publishers/\n│   │   │   └── publisher.ex           # FleetPrompt.Publishers.Publisher schema (fleet.publishers)\n│   │   ├── installs/\n│   │   │   └── install.ex             # FleetPrompt.Installs.Install schema (fleet.installs)\n│   │   ├── trust/\n│   │   │   ├── engine.ex              # FleetPrompt.TrustEngine — 4-signal score computation\n│   │   │   ├── worker.ex              # FleetPrompt.TrustWorker — GenServer per agent\n│   │   │   └── supervisor.ex          # FleetPrompt.TrustSupervisor — DynamicSupervisor\n│   │   ├── registry.ex                # FleetPrompt.Registry — manifest CRUD, version management\n│   │   ├── search/\n│   │   │   ├── index.ex               # FleetPrompt.SearchIndex — pg_trgm + ts_vector management\n│   │   │   └── query.ex               # FleetPrompt.Search — search query builder\n│   │   ├── forks.ex                   # FleetPrompt.Forks — fork-and-customize workflow\n│   │   ├── install_engine.ex          # FleetPrompt.InstallEngine — deploy orchestration\n│   │   ├── audit_writer.ex            # FleetPrompt.AuditWriter — Broadway append-only audit\n│   │   ├── webhook_dispatcher.ex      # FleetPrompt.WebhookDispatcher — Oban async webhooks\n│   │   ├── pipeline_intake.ex         # FleetPrompt.PipelineIntake — dark factory event handler\n│   │   └── mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex              # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 11)\n│   │       └── tools.ex               # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   ├── fleet_prompt.ex                # Application entry point\n│   └── fleet_prompt_web/\n│       ├── router.ex                  # Phoenix router\n│       ├── live/\n│       │   ├── search_live.ex         # LiveView — agent search (⌘K)\n│       │   ├── agent_detail_live.ex   # LiveView — agent detail + manifest\n│       │   ├── trust_dashboard_live.ex # LiveView — trust score dashboard\n│       │   └── publisher_live.ex      # LiveView — publisher profile\n│       └── controllers/\n│           ├── api_controller.ex      # REST API for programmatic access\n│           └── webhook_controller.ex  # POST /api/pipeline/intake (CloudEvents)\n├── test/\n│   ├── trust/\n│   │   ├── engine_test.exs\n│   │   └── worker_test.exs\n│   ├── search/\n│   │   ├── index_test.exs\n│   │   └── query_test.exs\n│   ├── pipeline_intake_test.exs\n│   ├── forks_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_manifest.json\n│       └── consolidation_event.json\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-68921","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-130457","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-68922","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-130458","text":"Phase 1: Core Registry (weeks 1-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-68923","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68925","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130459","marks":["bold"],"text":"Set up Phoenix project"},{"id":"spn-130460","text":" with Ecto, Supabase config, LiveView"}]}],"id":"blk-68924","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68927","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130461","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Ecto schemas"},{"id":"spn-130462","text":" (sections 3-4)"}]}],"id":"blk-68926","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-68928","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68930","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130463","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Publishers.Publisher"},{"id":"spn-130464","text":" with workspace_id, user_id (Supabase Auth)"}]}],"id":"blk-68929","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68932","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130465","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Agents.Agent"},{"id":"spn-130466","text":" with workspace_id, search_vector"}]}],"id":"blk-68931","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68934","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130467","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Manifests.Manifest"},{"id":"spn-130468","text":" with all fields from section 4.1"}]}],"id":"blk-68933","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68936","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130469","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Installs.Install"},{"id":"spn-130470","text":" with workspace_id"}]}],"id":"blk-68935","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68938","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130471","text":"Audit events schema with workspace_id"}]}],"id":"blk-68937","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-68939","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68941","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130472","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Registry"},{"id":"spn-130473","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-130474","marks":["code"],"text":"registry.ex"},{"id":"spn-130475","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-68940","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-68942","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68944","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130476","text":"Manifest CRUD with version immutability"}]}],"id":"blk-68943","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68946","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130477","text":"Version management (semver enforcement)"}]}],"id":"blk-68945","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68948","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130478","text":"Status transitions: draft → published → deprecated → yanked"}]}],"id":"blk-68947","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-68949","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68951","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130479","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement ETS caches"}]}],"id":"blk-68950","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":4},{"id":"blk-68952","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68954","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130480","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_manifests"},{"id":"spn-130481","text":" — agent_id:version → manifest map"}]}],"id":"blk-68953","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68956","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130482","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_trust_scores"},{"id":"spn-130483","text":" — agent_id → {score, computed_at}"}]}],"id":"blk-68955","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68958","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130484","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_search_index"},{"id":"spn-130485","text":" — trigram → [agent_id]"}]}],"id":"blk-68957","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68960","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130486","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_categories"},{"id":"spn-130487","text":" — category_slug → [agent_id]"}]}],"id":"blk-68959","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-68961","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-130488","text":"Phase 2: Trust Engine (weeks 4-8)"}]},{"id":"blk-68962","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68964","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130489","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustEngine"},{"id":"spn-130490","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-130491","marks":["code"],"text":"trust/engine.ex"},{"id":"spn-130492","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-68963","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-68965","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68967","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130493","text":"4 weighted signals: test_coverage (30%), spec_compliance (25%), usage_history (25%), audit_quality (20%)"}]}],"id":"blk-68966","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68969","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130494","marks":["code"],"text":"compute/1"},{"id":"spn-130495","text":" → integer 0-100"}]}],"id":"blk-68968","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68971","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130496","text":"Individual signal computations from section 5.1"}]}],"id":"blk-68970","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-68972","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68974","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130497","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustWorker"},{"id":"spn-130498","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-130499","marks":["code"],"text":"trust/worker.ex"},{"id":"spn-130500","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-68973","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-68975","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68977","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130501","text":"GenServer per agent"}]}],"id":"blk-68976","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68979","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130502","text":"Computes initial score on publish"}]}],"id":"blk-68978","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68981","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130503","text":"Recomputes on new data (installs, test results, audits)"}]}],"id":"blk-68980","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68983","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130504","text":"Caches in ETS"}]}],"id":"blk-68982","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68985","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130505","text":"Broadcasts via PubSub"}]}],"id":"blk-68984","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68987","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130506","text":"Hibernates after 5 minutes inactivity"}]}],"id":"blk-68986","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-68988","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68990","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130507","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustSupervisor"},{"id":"spn-130508","text":" — DynamicSupervisor managing TrustWorkers"}]}],"id":"blk-68989","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-68991","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-130509","text":"Phase 3: Search (weeks 6-10)"}]},{"id":"blk-68992","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68994","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130510","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement full-text search"},{"id":"spn-130511","text":" (section 8)"}]}],"id":"blk-68993","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-68995","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68997","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130512","text":"ts_vector generated column on agents (name A, description B, tags C)"}]}],"id":"blk-68996","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68999","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130513","text":"pg_trgm fuzzy matching indexes"}]}],"id":"blk-68998","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-69001","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130514","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Search.search/2"},{"id":"spn-130515","text":" with filters: min_trust, category, runtime, limit"}]}],"id":"blk-69000","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-69003","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130516","text":"Ranking: ts_rank descending, then trust_score descending"}]}],"id":"blk-69002","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-69004","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-130517","text":"Phase 4: Publish Pipeline (weeks 8-12)"}]},{"id":"blk-69005","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-69007","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130518","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement publish flow"},{"id":"spn-130519","text":" (section 6)"}]}],"id":"blk-69006","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-69008","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-69010","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130520","text":"Manifest validation → spec validation → duplicate check → trust computation → index update → audit + notify"}]}],"id":"blk-69009","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-69012","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130521","text":"Version immutability enforcement"}]}],"id":"blk-69011","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-69014","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130522","text":"Yank support (hides from search, preserves record)"}]}],"id":"blk-69013","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-69015","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-69017","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130523","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement AuditWriter"},{"id":"spn-130524","text":" — Broadway pipeline for batched audit writes"}]}],"id":"blk-69016","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-69019","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130525","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement WebhookDispatcher"},{"id":"spn-130526","text":" — Oban worker for async webhook delivery with retry/backoff"}]}],"id":"blk-69018","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-69020","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-130527","text":"Phase 5: Install Pipeline (weeks 10-14)"}]},{"id":"blk-69021","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-69023","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-130528","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement install flow"},{"id":"spn-130529","text":" (section 7)"}]}],"id":"blk-69022","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-69024","items"